---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import sessions from '../../data/sessions.json';import slides from '../../data/slides.json';import {asset} from '../../data/curriculum';
export function getStaticPaths(){return sessions.map(session=>({params:{id:session.id},props:{session}}));}
const{session:s}=Astro.props;const pages=slides.filter(p=>p.session===s.id);const collections=await Promise.all((['chapters','advanced'] as const).map(async(kind)=>(await getCollection(kind)).filter(e=>e.data.sessions.includes(s.id)).map(e=>({id:e.id,title:e.data.title,kind:kind==='chapters'?'read':kind}))));
---
<Base title={s.title} active="sessions/"><div class="page-wrap"><header class="page-title"><a href={asset('sessions/')}>← 会议资料</a><span class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:25px">{s.date} · {s.time}</span><h1>{s.title}</h1><p>{s.speakers}</p></header><article data-pagefind-body data-pagefind-weight="0.2"><div class="source-note"><b>材料如何使用</b><p>讲义保留原作者表达；妙记摘录经过整理而非逐字引用。版本、性能数字与未发布提案需要结合课程中的官方来源核验。</p>{s.id.includes('keynotes')&&<p>{s.date==='2026-09-08'?'录音约从 09:05 开始，开场未完整覆盖；14 页讲义仅对应其中 From Containers to Agents 短场次。':'录音约覆盖 09:05:53–10:15:12，不能代表全部上午议程。'}</p>}</div><h2>在教程中理解</h2><div class="resource-grid">{collections.flat().map(e=><a class="resource-card" href={asset(`${e.kind}/${e.id}/`)}><h2>{e.title}</h2><p>进入连贯讲解 →</p></a>)}</div><h2 style="margin-top:40px">逐页知识索引</h2>{pages.length?<table class="slide-index"><thead><tr><th>页</th><th>知识点与选择</th><th>原图</th></tr></thead><tbody>{pages.map(p=><tr id={`page-${p.page}`}><td>{p.page}</td><td><b>{p.title}</b><p>{p.description}</p><details><summary>查看本页文字索引</summary><pre style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12px">{p.text}</pre></details><small>{p.selected?'精选：用于机制、流程、代码或实验解释':'资料索引：背景、过渡、重复内容或留作进一步查阅'}</small></td><td>{p.image?<a data-zoom data-caption={`${s.title} · 第 ${p.page} 页`} href={asset(p.highres!)}><img src={asset(p.image)} width="180" alt={p.title} loading="lazy"/></a>:'—'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table>:<p>此场没有已归档公开讲义。教程依据妙记整理机制，并使用标注为教学重构的图解；未补造原始 slide。</p>}<p style="margin-top:25px"><a href="https://www.lfopensource.cn/kubecon-cloudnativecon-openinfra-summit-pytorch-conference-china/program/schedule/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">官方日程与材料入口 ↗</a></p></article></div></Base>
